    "created_at": "2015-10-05T13:05:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-05T13:05:24Z",
    "body": "We cannot really do this I unless there's at least one other vendor planning to follow suit. In the past one vendor was sufficient, but the balance of power has shifted somewhat and now it seems to require at least two.\n",
