    "created_at": "2015-10-05T14:31:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-05T14:31:42Z",
    "body": "Wouldn't it be trivial to implement this?\n\nThis is one of many cases where nobody really has an incentive to do anything, where insisting on proof of harm or benefit will just leave us in the non-interoperable status quo. When it doesn't really matter much in practice, then the shortest path to interop is my default preference.\n",
