    "body": "`Node.isSameNode()` is a similar case, except that it was already removed from the spec and usage was even lower. In that case, I [wanted to remove it from Blink](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msg/blink-dev/CpIy0Pzcg4E/jRl4MEQRQD0J), but didn't get support for that and came away agreeing that it wouldn't be a good use of our time.\n",
