    "body": "I took a look at httparchive data and found a lot of sites using `initMessageEvent()` via this library: https://github.com/gimite/web-socket-js/blob/master/web_socket.js\n\nHowever, it's a Flash-based fallback for `WebSocket` so that code is unreachable unless `window.WEB_SOCKET_FORCE_FLASH` is set.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
