    "body": "Given https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-initevent don't all events need to be mutable anyway? Even if `initEvent()` itself were not a thing, most common event types have `init*Event()` methods in https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#legacy-event-initializer-interfaces\n",
