    "created_at": "2015-10-20T13:00:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T13:00:41Z",
    "body": "I agree. It was added back to the spec because at the time it was the most used of the events that had been removed from `createEvent`, and it was still supported by multiple browsers.\n\nAlso \"nobody complained\" seems false given https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=949376 was reported because it regressed https://github.com/gimite/web-socket-js in Firefox 26. It appears it is implemented now in Gecko, yes?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
