    "created_at": "2015-10-20T14:01:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T14:01:38Z",
    "body": "> It appears it is implemented now in Gecko, yes?\n\nOh, I guess @Ms2ger misremembered in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/228#issue-109779521, it is currently in Gecko:\nhttps://github.com/mozilla/gecko-dev/blob/3198b767f9b26c310afd73cc7a8d4f99c05101e9/dom/webidl/MessageEvent.webidl#L49\n\nSo, since it seems that it is already supported by all engines (except Servo) I'm going to close this.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
